    "ferment",
    "pan-fry"
  ],
  "serving_suggestion": "May be served with different types of chutneys.",
  "notes": "A recipe with WHOLE GRAINS (brown rice), BEANS (toor dal, urad dal, moong dal, chana dal), LEAFY GREENS (moringa leaves), HERBS & SPICES (various).",
